  msgSignIn: 'Sign in first: reports come from a GlowUp account.'
  msgReading: Reading the text on this phone...
  msgReadDone: Read on this phone. Check and correct it. The photo is not sent.
  msgNothingRead: No text was found in that photo. Hold the label flat, in good light,
    and try again, or type it.
  msgBarcodeHint: Hold the barcode inside the frame
  msgPhotoHint: Fill the frame with the ingredient list, then tap the button
  msgBarcodeRead: Barcode read. Check the digits.
  msgSending: Sending...
  msgStillSending: Still sending. Retry checks again; the report is never sent twice.
  msgStoppedWaiting: Stopped waiting. Your entries are kept. If the report already
    left, it arrives only once.
  msgSent: An admin will check it. The reply appears in Notifications.
  msgSentOffline: 'No internet: your report is kept on this phone and sent when you
    are online. The reply appears in Notifications.'
  confirmTitle: Discard this report?
  confirmMessage: What you entered is not sent.
  confirmDiscard: Discard
  confirmKeep: Keep editing
